{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34019","headline":"寄题玉霄峰叶涵象尊师所居 · 皮日休","name":"寄题玉霄峰叶涵象尊师所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青冥向上玉霄峰，元始先生戴紫蓉。\n晓案琼文光洞壑，夜坛香气惹杉松。\n闲迎仙客来爲鹤，静噀灵符去是龙。\n子细扪心无偃骨，欲随师去肯相容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34019.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34019","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}